Key review areas:

1. **`TuiChord.parse` rewrite** — the new implementation:
```dart
factory TuiChord.parse(String text) {
    final raw = text.trim().toLowerCase().replaceAll(RegExp(r'[\s_-]+'), '+');
    final parts = [
      for (final p in raw.split('+')) _glyphFromDisplay[p] ?? _keyAliases[p] ?? p,
    ];
    while (parts.isNotEmpty && parts.first.isEmpty) {
      parts.removeAt(0);
    }
    while (parts.isNotEmpty && parts.last.isEmpty) {
      parts.removeLast();
    }
    return TuiChord(parts.join('+'));
  }
```

Behavioral differences vs the old implementation:
- Old: replaces `[\s_-]+` with `+` on the whole string FIRST, then checked glyph equality on the WHOLE string (t == e.value), then `replaceFirst` anchored `^` for option/opt/cmd/command/pgdn.
